Done. Here's a summary of the component:

**`SortableList.razor`** — Renders each item via `ItemTemplate` with "Move Up"/"Move Down" buttons. Buttons are disabled at boundaries.

**`SortableList.razor.cs`** — Generic `partial class`:
- Copies `Items` into a private `_items` list in `OnParametersSet` (never mutates the passed-in list).
- `MoveUp`/`MoveDown` swap items in the internal copy, then invoke `OnOrderChanged` with a read-only snapshot.

Usage matches your example — just note the callback signature is `EventCallback<IReadOnlyList<TItem>>`:

